        "text_NHEtWm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><em><strong>Clean Ingredients. Honest Nutrition. Real Results.</strong></em><br>Your body thrives on clean fuel, real nutrients, and a system that actually supports how you live.<br>Zeotein was created to take the guesswork and overwhelm out of wellness — and replace it with something simple, powerful, and effective.<br>This isn’t just a shake.<br>It’s a smarter daily ritual designed to help your body feel lighter, clearer, and more energized — without the clutter of multiple supplements.<br><br></p>"
