        "heading_EyBRRQ": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What Makes Zeotein Different"
          }
        },
        "text_XzNEnF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>1. A Clean, Multi-Functional Formula</strong></h3><p>Zeotein isn’t built like traditional proteins.<br><br>We use <strong>bone broth and collagen</strong> — giving you:</p><ul>\n<li>Easier digestion<br>\n</li>\n<li>Less bloating<br>\n</li>\n<li>Joint, skin, and gut support<br>\n</li>\n<li>A gentler protein source<br>\n</li>\n</ul><p>Plus the 5 essentials your body needs daily:</p><ul>\n<li>Detox support<br>\n</li>\n<li>Minerals<br>\n</li>\n<li>Nourishment<br>\n</li>\n<li>Clean energy<br>\n</li>\n<li>Restoration<br>\n</li>\n</ul><p>Full-spectrum nutrition — not single-purpose protein.</p><h3><strong>2. The Zeolite Advantage</strong></h3><p>Zeolite is a rare volcanic mineral with a natural negative charge.<br><br>It binds toxins, impurities, and heavy metals that weigh your system down.</p><p>When the body is clearer:</p><ul>\n<li>Digestion improves<br>\n</li>\n<li>Cravings calm<br>\n</li>\n<li>Metabolism responds<br>\n</li>\n<li>Energy stabilizes<br>\n</li>\n<li>Nutrient absorption increases<br>\n</li>\n</ul><p>This is the backbone of the Zeotein difference.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
